OL,3,GNEWSA'It was paradise': Residents
OL,4,Areflect on life in UK's first New Town
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was paradise."
OL,8,FBrenda Harvey is remembering when she,
OL,9,Fhusband Keith and their first child
OL,10,Fmoved to their new home in Stevenage in
OL,11,F1968.
OL,13,FThey were among the families from
OL,14,FLondon who took up Stevenage
OL,15,FDevelopment Corporation's offer of a
OL,16,Fchoice of rented housing if they
OL,17,Fsecured a job in the Hertfordshire
OL,18,Ftown, which became the UK's first New
OL,19,FTown 80 years ago.
